# Direct test dependencies. Regenerate the hashed lock with:
# uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes --upgrade \
#   --exclude-newer <UTC date seven days ago> \
#   requirements-dev.in --output-file requirements-dev.txt
# The cutoff matches Dependabot's seven-day cooldown; drop it only for a
# security fix.
# Home Assistant is intentionally not installed here: tests/conftest.py supplies
# narrow API doubles before importing the integration, so the former package
# was unused while pulling a large runtime dependency tree into CI.
